03:09.200 --> 03:12.440
if value is greater than 1200,

03:12.440 --> 03:13.400
what do we want to do?

03:13.400 --> 03:16.480
We want to navigate user to Pokedex.

03:16.480 --> 03:18.960
That's the pseudo code. How do we do that?

03:18.960 --> 03:22.440
Well, because we're inside of Composition API,

03:22.440 --> 03:24.360
and to be honest, I think this tends to be

03:24.360 --> 03:25.800
the easier way going forward to use with

03:25.800 --> 03:28.040
view libraries and this is why we're going to do it this way.

03:28.040 --> 03:31.880
