03:31.880 --> 03:34.520
So, if you're in the options API for those from View2,

03:34.520 --> 03:38.720
you might remember something like this.router.push.

03:38.720 --> 03:40.400
That should look pretty familiar.

03:40.400 --> 03:43.800
But, there's no this context inside of Composition API.

03:43.800 --> 03:47.200
