03:47.200 --> 03:49.040
Helper methods are basically the name of

03:49.040 --> 03:50.920
the game when it comes to View3.

03:50.920 --> 03:54.120
So, from View Router, what do you think we called it?

03:54.120 --> 03:57.440
Well, it is useRouter.

03:57.440 --> 03:58.840
Because, what are we doing?

03:58.840 --> 04:00.800
We're basically going to call the router.

04:00.800 --> 04:01.560
